        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents A03-R2414, 4 Inch x 14 Inch Classic Floor Air Register</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Classic 4 Inch x 14 Inch Register with Damper allows you to control the air flow into the room with a toggle lever. This brass floor vent has a timeless style that will make it a classic in home decor. It is available in an assortment of traditional finishes including polished brass and satin nickel. The 4 Inch x 14 Inch Classic Floor Air Register is easy to install and will fit in any new or existing 4x14 floor opening. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Also Available Matching:</b>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"/products/classic-4-inch-x-10-inch-register-with-damper-brass-accents-a03-r2410\"<b>4 Inch x 10 Inch Classic Floor Register</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/classic-4-inch-x-12-inch-register-with-damper-brass-accents-a03-r2412\"<b>4 Inch x 12 Inch Classic Floor Register</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Classic 4 Inch x 14 Inch Brass Register:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Length: 14\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes Damper Box to control the airflow.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Brass Accents Floor Air Register is designed to fit snugly into ducts. When determining the size of register you require, measure the opening in the floor and not the overall size of any existing registers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BRA-reg-finishes.jpg?v=1704354502\" width=\"566\" height=\"139\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Brass Accents Register Finishes\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
